{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400050/extras/053b976ed38c4d16548e1f884c1711d9.poster.avif?t=1760271035\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400050/extras/053b976ed38c4d16548e1f884c1711d9.webm?t=1760271035\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400050/extras/053b976ed38c4d16548e1f884c1711d9.mp4?t=1760271035\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage, Build, Explore and Prosper in Your Own Medieval StartUp!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the keeper of a tavern nestled deep within an ancient swamp, you\u2019ll need to balance <strong>commerce, resources, and customer satisfaction</strong> to grow your establishment \u2014 and eventually build an entire village around your success!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2699\ufe0f <strong>Core Gameplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tavern Management</strong>: Serve your customers, manage your stock, and recruit workers to keep your business thriving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400050/extras/d41cf329db8e03c08b23e7f63a78f9fe.poster.avif?t=1760271035\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400050/extras/d41cf329db8e03c08b23e7f63a78f9fe.webm?t=1760271035\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400050/extras/d41cf329db8e03c08b23e7f63a78f9fe.mp4?t=1760271035\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crafting and Production</strong>: Turn your gathered resources into meals, drinks, and furniture. Unlock new professions such as <strong>carpentry, baking, blacksmithing, farming</strong>, and many more to discover as you play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration</strong>: Venture beyond your tavern to gather rare resources and uncover the forgotten secrets hidden in the swamp.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Development &amp; Expansion :\u00a0</strong>Upgrade your tavern into a full inn, build guest rooms, open market stands, and diversify your sources of income.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400050/extras/9951a262ed49ea5411ab4c7903df9c6e.poster.avif?t=1760271035\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400050/extras/9951a262ed49ea5411ab4c7903df9c6e.webm?t=1760271035\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400050/extras/9951a262ed49ea5411ab4c7903df9c6e.mp4?t=1760271035\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udce6 <strong>Included Content</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several hours of engaging gameplay with progression and storytelling.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over <strong>50 unique recipes</strong> to unlock and craft.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A complete management system covering <strong>finances, staff, production, and loans</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ability to <strong>automate tasks</strong> as your StartUp grows.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfa8\u00a0<strong>Graphics and Sound Design</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>polished low-poly art style</strong> for a cozy, stylized medieval feel.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>dynamic day/night cycle</strong> with evolving lighting and ambience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>warm, living world</strong>, where every NPC adds life to your tavern and its surroundings.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udea7 <strong>In Development</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Medieval StartUp</i> is currently in <strong>Early Access</strong>.<br>New content will be added regularly, including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New <strong>biomes</strong> and areas to explore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More <strong>recipes, items, and crafting options</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional <strong>quests, NPC interactions, and dynamic events</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step into the world of Medieval StartUp,</strong> grow your small tavern into a thriving landmark at the heart of the kingdom!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3400050?t=1760271035","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400050/eb04ae5c48a0b7f7dfc5e960936d7489b0a8d76d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760271035","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400050/b88a296e7156a0e2ed8372ce27af200635c9e23a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760271035","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400050/b88a296e7156a0e2ed8372ce27af200635c9e23a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760271035","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Chat Speech-to-text","id":72},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Narrated Game Menus","id":71},{