f329db8e03c08b23e7f63a78f9fe.webm?t=1760271035\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400050/extras/d41cf329db8e03c08b23e7f63a78f9fe.mp4?t=1760271035\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crafting and Production</strong>: Turn your gathered resources into meals, drinks, and furniture. Unlock new professions such as <strong>carpentry, baking, blacksmithing, farming</strong>, and many more to discover as you play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration</strong>: Venture beyond your tavern to gather rare resources and uncover the forgotten secrets hidden in the swamp.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Development &amp; Expansion :\u00a0</strong>Upgrade your tavern into a full inn, build guest rooms, open market stands, and diversify your sources of income.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400050/extras/9951a262ed49ea5411ab4c7903df9c6e.poster.avif?t=1760271035\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400050/extras/9951a262ed49ea5411ab4c7903df9c6e.webm?t=1760271035\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400050/extras/9951a262ed49ea5411ab4c7903df9c6e.mp4?t=1760271035\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udce6 <strong>Included Content</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several hours of engaging gameplay with progression and storytelling.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over <strong>50 unique recipes</strong> to unlock and craft.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A complete management system covering <strong>finances, staff, production, and loans</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ability to <strong>automate tasks</strong> as your StartUp grows.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfa8\u00a0<strong>Graphics and Sound Design</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>polished low-poly art style</strong> for a cozy, stylized medieval feel.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>dynamic day/night cycle</strong> with evolving lighting and ambience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>warm, living world</strong>, where every NPC adds life to your tavern and its surroundings.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udea7 <strong>In Development</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Medieval StartUp</i> is currently in <strong>Early Access</strong>.<br>New content will be added regularly, including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New <strong>biomes</strong> and areas to explore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More <strong>recipes, items, and crafting options</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional <strong>quests, NPC interactions, and dynamic events</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step into the world of Medieval StartUp,</strong> grow your small tavern into a thriving landmark at the heart of the kingdom!</p>","developers":["Editions Aspic Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400050/5da503cd5190f1e85267b409a165e4a5d57d05e6/header.jpg?t=1760271035","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 Editions Aspic Games. Tous droits r\u00e9serv\u00e9s.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nToute reproduction ou distribution non autoris\u00e9e de ce jeu est strictement interdite.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_